Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"doris__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——Doris 的&quot;事务&quot;主要存在于导入路径：Stream Load 的 label 去重与单批原子性、两阶段提交（2PC）预提交/提交、Group Commit 攒批事务；查询侧是快照读。不支持通用 OLTP 式多语句交互事务与标准隔离级别语义，不要按关系型事务数据库做选型假设。（证据：强）</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——Doris 的&quot;事务&quot;主要存在于导入路径：Stream Load 的 label 去重与单批原子性、两阶段提交（2PC）预提交/提交、Group Commit 攒批事务；查询侧是快照读。不支持通用 OLTP 式多语句交互事务与标准隔离级别语义，不要按关系型事务数据库做选型假设。（证据：强）</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — Doris &quot;transactions&quot; live mainly on the ingestion path: Stream Load label dedup with per-batch atomicity, two-phase commit (2PC) pre-commit/commit, …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — Doris &quot;transactions&quot; live mainly on the ingestion path: Stream Load label dedup with per-batch atomicity, two-phase commit (2PC) pre-commit/commit, Group Commit batched transactions; queries are snapshot reads. No general-purpose OLTP-style multi-statement interactive transactions or standard isolation-level semantics — do not select it as a transactional database. (Evidence: strong)</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "doris__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——数据层按 Tablet 多副本（默认 3 副本）分布在 BE 上，副本故障后自动修复与重平衡；FE 元数据多节点高可用（基于 bdbje）。单副本写入多数派确认等协议级细节本轮未做源码级核实。（证据：中）</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——数据层按 Tablet 多副本（默认 3 副本）分布在 BE 上，副本故障后自动修复与重平衡；FE 元数据多节点高可用（基于 bdbje）。单副本写入多数派确认等协议级细节本轮未做源码级核实。（证据：中）</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — data is replicated per Tablet (default 3 replicas) across BEs, with automatic replica repair and rebalancing on BE failure/scale-out; FE metadata is multi-nod…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — data is replicated per Tablet (default 3 replicas) across BEs, with automatic replica repair and rebalancing on BE failure/scale-out; FE metadata is multi-node HA (based on bdbje). Protocol-level details such as write quorums were not verified at source level in this round. (Evidence: medium)</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "doris__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——传统存算一体架构下 BE 可热扩容（注册新 BE 即加入集群，数据自动重平衡）；3.0 起的存算分离模式支持计算节点弹性扩缩。FE 扩容涉及元数据组变更，比 BE 重。（证据：强）</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——传统存算一体架构下 BE 可热扩容（注册新 BE 即加入集群，数据自动重平衡）；3.0 起的存算分离模式支持计算节点弹性扩缩。FE 扩容涉及元数据组变更，比 BE 重。（证据：强）</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">class-2 cost is O</span><p class=\"snippet\">class-2 cost is O(n) — more tablets / more data, slower; storage doubles during rewrite; alter_tablet_worker_count defaults to 3 and raising it adds IO pressure (official…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>class-2 cost is O(n) — more tablets / more data, slower; storage doubles during rewrite; alter_tablet_worker_count defaults to 3 and raising it adds IO pressure <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Semantics</strong>: rewrites run as background jobs — SHOW ALTER TABLE COLUMN for progress, CANCEL to abort <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; one schema change job per table at a time <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; no evidence found for whole-table DDL transactional semantics.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——v1.4.0 起支持透明加密：ATTACH &#x27;f.db&#x27; AS d (ENCRYPTION_KEY &#x27;...&#x27;)，AES-256-GCM（默认）/ AES-CTR-256，覆盖主文件、WAL 和溢出临时文件；密钥丢失则数据不可恢复，不支持原地加密/解密/轮换（需 COPY 到新库）；官方声明尚未达到 NIST 合规要求（跟踪 iss…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——v1.4.0 起支持透明加密：<code>ATTACH &#x27;f.db&#x27; AS d (ENCRYPTION_KEY &#x27;...&#x27;)</code>，AES-256-GCM（默认）/ AES-CTR-256，覆盖主文件、WAL 和溢出临时文件；密钥丢失则数据不可恢复，不支持原地加密/解密/轮换（需 COPY 到新库）；官方声明尚未达到 NIST 合规要求（跟踪 issue #20162）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（1.4.0 发布公告、encryption 博客）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — since v1.4.0: ATTACH &#x27;f.db&#x27; AS d (ENCRYPTION_KEY &#x27;...&#x27;), AES-256-GCM (default) / AES-CTR-256, covering the main file, WAL, and spilled temp files; a lost key …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — since v1.4.0: <code>ATTACH &#x27;f.db&#x27; AS d (ENCRYPTION_KEY &#x27;...&#x27;)</code>, AES-256-GCM (default) / AES-CTR-256, covering the main file, WAL, and spilled temp files; a lost key means unrecoverable data; no in-place encrypt/decrypt/re-key (copy to a new database instead); officially not yet NIST-compliant (tracked in issue #20162). Evidence: official docs (1.4.0 release notes, encryption blog).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用——进程内嵌入式，无服务端、无网络协议、无监听端口；httpfs 读 S3/HTTPS 是客户端 TLS；云端传输加密是 MotherDuck 托管服务的能力。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（架构）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>——进程内嵌入式，无服务端、无网络协议、无监听端口；httpfs 读 S3/HTTPS 是客户端 TLS；云端传输加密是 MotherDuck 托管服务的能力。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（架构）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A — in-process e</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A — in-process embedded library, no server, no network protocol, no listening port; httpfs reading S3/HTTPS is client-side TLS; cloud transport encryption is MotherDuck…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> — in-process embedded library, no server, no network protocol, no listening port; httpfs reading S3/HTTPS is client-side TLS; cloud transport encryption is MotherDuck&#x27;s managed-service capability. Evidence: official docs (architecture).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——SQL 方言对标 PostgreSQL（非 PG 线协议）；扩展可 ATTACH 外部库做联邦查询（postgres/sqlite/mysql 扫描扩展）；Python/R/Arrow/Polars/pandas 零拷贝集成；dbt 有社区适配器 dbt-duckdb；WASM 可跑浏览器。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——SQL 方言对标 PostgreSQL（非 PG 线协议）；扩展可 ATTACH 外部库做联邦查询（postgres/sqlite/mysql 扫描扩展）；Python/R/Arrow/Polars/pandas 零拷贝集成；dbt 有社区适配器 dbt-duckdb；WASM 可跑浏览器。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — SQL dialect targets PostgreSQL (not the PG wire protocol); extensions ATTACH external databases for federated scans (postgres/sqlite/mysql); zero-co…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — SQL dialect targets PostgreSQL (not the PG wire protocol); extensions ATTACH external databases for federated scans (postgres/sqlite/mysql); zero-copy Python/R/Arrow/Polars/pandas integration; community dbt-duckdb adapter; WASM runs in browsers. Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——MIT 全开源，无功能阉割的社区版；DuckDB Foundation（非营利）持有 IP；商业化 = DuckLabs（原 DuckDB Labs）支持/咨询服务 + MotherDuck 独立公司的 serverless 托管（按存储 GB 与计算秒计费，免费层 10GB——厂商口径）。2026-08-26 DuckLabs 宣…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——MIT 全开源，无功能阉割的社区版；DuckDB Foundation（非营利）持有 IP；商业化 = DuckLabs（原 DuckDB Labs）支持/咨询服务 + MotherDuck 独立公司的 serverless 托管（按存储 GB 与计算秒计费，免费层 10GB——厂商口径）。2026-08-26 DuckLabs 宣布加入 AWS，开源项目治理与许可不变（官方口径）。证据：官方 history + AWS 官方博客。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — fully MIT open source, no crippled community edition; DuckDB Foundation (non-profit) holds the IP; commercialization = DuckLabs (formerly DuckDB Labs) support…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — fully MIT open source, no crippled community edition; DuckDB Foundation (non-profit) holds the IP; commercialization = DuckLabs (formerly DuckDB Labs) support/consulting + MotherDuck&#x27;s independent serverless hosting (per-GB storage and per-second compute, 10GB free tier — vendor claim). On 2026-08-26 DuckLabs announced joining AWS; open-source governance and license unchanged (official statement). Evidence: official history + AWS official blog.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——官方文档为英文；中文资料以博客、课程、知乎/CSDN 实践帖为主，体量远小于 MySQL/PG 及国产主流库；出海/英文生态反而是强项。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——官方文档为英文；中文资料以博客、课程、知乎/CSDN 实践帖为主，体量远小于 MySQL/PG 及国产主流库；出海/英文生态反而是强项。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — official docs are English; Chinese material is mostly blogs, courses, and community practice posts, far smaller than for MySQL/PG or major domestic …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — official docs are English; Chinese material is mostly blogs, courses, and community practice posts, far smaller than for MySQL/PG or major domestic databases; the English/international ecosystem is a strength instead. Evidence: community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（嵌入式 OLAP 单机极快；无分布式）。 进程内列存向量化执行，笔记本上 TB 级以下分析查询秒级<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>社区共识。 无分布式，并行上限为单机核数；超大内存需求靠溢出到磁盘 官方文档。 读 Parquet/CSV 极快，是“单机数仓”的事实标准 社区共识。 第三方印证：2026-10-01 AWS 官方博客宣布在 Aurora P…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（嵌入式 OLAP 单机极快；无分布式）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>进程内列存向量化执行，笔记本上 TB 级以下分析查询秒级<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无分布式，并行上限为单机核数；超大内存需求靠溢出到磁盘 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>读 Parquet/CSV 极快，是“单机数仓”的事实标准 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>第三方印证：2026-10-01 AWS 官方博客宣布在 Aurora PostgreSQL 内嵌入 DuckDB（<code>aurora_analytics</code> 扩展）做 Iceberg/Parquet 分析扫描——&quot;嵌入式分析引擎能被装进其他系统&quot;论点的厂商级背书。但内嵌的 DuckDB 版本与功能裁剪情况未公开，尚无独立第三方性能对比：背书的是架构选择，不是性能数字 <code>AWS 官方博客</code>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (blazing embedded OLAP; no distribution). In-process columnar vectorized execution: sub-TB analytical queries in seconds on a laptop <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> (comm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (blazing embedded OLAP; no distribution).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In-process columnar vectorized execution: sub-TB analytical queries in seconds on a laptop <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No distribution; parallelism capped by single-machine cores; spills to disk when memory is exceeded <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Extremely fast Parquet/CSV reads — the de-facto “single-machine warehouse” <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Third-party endorsement: on 2026-10-01 AWS announced DuckDB embedded inside Aurora PostgreSQL (the <code>aurora_analytics</code> extension) for Iceberg/Parquet analytical scans — a vendor-grade endorsement of the &quot;embeddable analytics engine&quot; thesis. Caveats: the embedded DuckDB version and any feature trimming are undisclosed, and no independent third-party performance comparison exists — the endorsement covers the architecture choice, not performance numbers <code>(AWS official blog)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（嵌入式无；MotherDuck 云服务有 SOC2）。 DuckDB 嵌入式库：无合规认证概念，合规责任在宿主应用 社区共识。 MotherDuck（云服务）：SOC2<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（嵌入式无；MotherDuck 云服务有 SOC2）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DuckDB 嵌入式库：无合规认证概念，合规责任在宿主应用 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>MotherDuck（云服务）：SOC2<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (embedded has none; MotherDuck cloud has SOC2). DuckDB embedded library: compliance doesn&#x27;t apply; the host application is responsible (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (embedded has none; MotherDuck cloud has SOC2).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DuckDB embedded library: compliance doesn&#x27;t apply; the host application is responsible <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>MotherDuck (cloud service): SOC2 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（2018 年诞生；嵌入式 OLAP 的现象级项目）。 2018 年由 CWI（荷兰数学与计算机中心）发布；DuckDB Labs/MotherDuck 商业化 社区共识。 GitHub stars 数万级，增长极快；基金会治理，中立性好 社区共识。 年轻但口碑极佳，“SQLite for Analytics”定位深入人心 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（2018 年诞生；嵌入式 OLAP 的现象级项目）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2018 年由 CWI（荷兰数学与计算机中心）发布；DuckDB Labs/MotherDuck 商业化 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>GitHub stars 数万级，增长极快；基金会治理，中立性好 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>年轻但口碑极佳，“SQLite for Analytics”定位深入人心 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (born 2018; the phenomenal embedded-OLAP project). Released 2018 by CWI (Dutch national research institute); commercialized via DuckDB Labs/MotherDuck (communit…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (born 2018; the phenomenal embedded-OLAP project).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Released 2018 by CWI (Dutch national research institute); commercialized via DuckDB Labs/MotherDuck <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Tens of thousands of GitHub stars and explosive growth; foundation-governed with good neutrality <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Young but superb reputation; the “SQLite for Analytics” positioning resonates widely <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（数据团队/个人开发者极广；企业级案例在积累）。 个人开发者、数据团队几乎人手一个<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>社区共识。 被大量数据工具内嵌（dbt 等）社区共识。 大型企业核心数仓案例少于 ClickHouse，MotherDuck 在积累 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（数据团队/个人开发者极广；企业级案例在积累）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>个人开发者、数据团队几乎人手一个<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>被大量数据工具内嵌（dbt 等）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>大型企业核心数仓案例少于 ClickHouse，MotherDuck 在积累 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (ubiquitous with data teams/individuals; enterprise cases accumulating). Nearly every data practitioner has one <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Emb…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (ubiquitous with data teams/individuals; enterprise cases accumulating).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nearly every data practitioner has one <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Embedded in many data tools (dbt etc.) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Fewer large-enterprise core-warehouse cases than ClickHouse; MotherDuck accumulating <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（文件即备份；无 CDC 概念）。 备份：文件拷贝即备份；MotherDuck 云同步/分享 官方文档。 无 CDC/复制工具链（嵌入式定位）；与 pandas/Arrow/dbt 集成极好 社区共识。 工具链薄是形态决定的 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（文件即备份；无 CDC 概念）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>备份：文件拷贝即备份；MotherDuck 云同步/分享 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无 CDC/复制工具链（嵌入式定位）；与 pandas/Arrow/dbt 集成极好 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>工具链薄是形态决定的 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (the file is the backup; no CDC concept). Backup: copy the file; MotherDuck cloud sync/sharing <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No CDC/replication toolchain (embedded…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (the file is the backup; no CDC concept).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backup: copy the file; MotherDuck cloud sync/sharing <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No CDC/replication toolchain (embedded by design); excellent pandas/Arrow/dbt integration <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Thin toolchain follows from the form factor <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（MotherDuck（Serverless 云））。 MotherDuck：DuckDB 的 Serverless 云服务，共享/协作 官方文档。 嵌入式本质不变：云是可选增强，不是必需 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（MotherDuck（Serverless 云））。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MotherDuck：DuckDB 的 Serverless 云服务，共享/协作 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>嵌入式本质不变：云是可选增强，不是必需 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (MotherDuck (serverless cloud)). MotherDuck: serverless cloud for DuckDB with sharing/collaboration <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Embedded nature unchanged: cloud is an opti…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (MotherDuck (serverless cloud)).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MotherDuck: serverless cloud for DuckDB with sharing/collaboration <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Embedded nature unchanged: cloud is an optional enhancement, not a requirement <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（COPY FROM/Parquet 直读，单机摄入极简）。 COPY FROM 支持 CSV/Parquet/JSON；read_parquet/read_csv 可直接查文件不导入 官方文档。 批量 INSERT 也快，单机分析场景摄入几乎零运维 社区共识。 大文件注意内存与临时目录，可用流式读 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（COPY FROM/Parquet 直读，单机摄入极简）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>COPY FROM 支持 CSV/Parquet/JSON；read_parquet/read_csv 可直接查文件不导入 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>批量 INSERT 也快，单机分析场景摄入几乎零运维 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>大文件注意内存与临时目录，可用流式读 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (COPY FROM/direct Parquet reads; trivial single-node ingest). COPY FROM supports CSV/Parquet/JSON; read_parquet/read_csv query files without importing (official…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (COPY FROM/direct Parquet reads; trivial single-node ingest).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>COPY FROM supports CSV/Parquet/JSON; read_parquet/read_csv query files without importing <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Batch INSERT is fast too; near-zero-ops ingestion for single-node analytics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Large files need memory/temp-dir care; streaming reads available <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用——无用户体系、无服务端审计日志；谁拿到文件谁就能读。审计需求由宿主应用自己实现。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（架构）+ 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>——无用户体系、无服务端审计日志；谁拿到文件谁就能读。审计需求由宿主应用自己实现。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（架构）+ 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A — no user mode</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A — no user model, no server-side audit log; whoever can read the file can read the data. Auditing is the host application&#x27;s job. Evidence: official docs (architecture)…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> — no user model, no server-side audit log; whoever can read the file can read the data. Auditing is the host application&#x27;s job. Evidence: official docs (architecture) + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（httpfs 直查对象存储；PG/MySQL scanner 扩展）。 httpfs 扩展可直接查询 S3/HTTP 上的 Parquet/CSV 官方文档。 postgres/mysql 扩展可把外部库表当本地表扫描 官方文档。 嵌入式场景下这是它最被低估的能力之一 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（httpfs 直查对象存储；PG/MySQL scanner 扩展）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>httpfs 扩展可直接查询 S3/HTTP 上的 Parquet/CSV <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>postgres/mysql 扩展可把外部库表当本地表扫描 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>嵌入式场景下这是它最被低估的能力之一 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (httpfs over object storage; PG/MySQL scanner extensions). httpfs extension queries Parquet/CSV on S3/HTTP directly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. postgres/mysql extensions s…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (httpfs over object storage; PG/MySQL scanner extensions).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>httpfs extension queries Parquet/CSV on S3/HTTP directly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>postgres/mysql extensions scan external tables as local ones <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>One of its most underrated capabilities in embedded scenarios <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（嵌入式无服务进程，无 CDC 语义）。 单进程嵌入式引擎，无变更日志/复制槽概念 官方文档。 数据同步靠重新导入文件或上层应用处理 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（嵌入式无服务进程，无 CDC 语义）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单进程嵌入式引擎，无变更日志/复制槽概念 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>数据同步靠重新导入文件或上层应用处理 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Embedded, no server process; no CDC semantics). Single-process embedded engine; no change log or replication slots <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Sync by re-importing files or han…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Embedded, no server process; no CDC semantics).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Single-process embedded engine; no change log or replication slots <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Sync by re-importing files or handling it in the application layer <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（嵌入式单机，无 TTL 机制）。 无原生 TTL/分区过期，需应用层 WHERE 过滤或定期 DELETE 官方文档。 定位是嵌入式分析引擎，数据生命周期由宿主应用管理 社区共识。 大删后需 VACUUM/重写回收空间 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（嵌入式单机，无 TTL 机制）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生 TTL/分区过期，需应用层 WHERE 过滤或定期 DELETE <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>定位是嵌入式分析引擎，数据生命周期由宿主应用管理 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>大删后需 VACUUM/重写回收空间 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Embedded single-node; no TTL mechanism). No native TTL or partition expiry; filter in the app layer or run periodic DELETEs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. As an embedded…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Embedded single-node; no TTL mechanism).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native TTL or partition expiry; filter in the app layer or run periodic DELETEs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>As an embedded engine, lifecycle is owned by the host application <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Reclaim space after big deletes via VACUUM/rewrite <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（嵌入式单机，无&quot;在线 DDL&quot;概念——schema 演进就是同一进程内对本地 catalog/文件执行的事务性 DDL，没有并发 DDL 阻塞或在线迁移窗口问题）。 只改定义不碰数据：ADD/DROP/RENAME COLUMN、改列 COMMENT/DEFAULT 都是 catalog 层变更；官方文档未明确说明物理重写代价（未…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（嵌入式单机，无&quot;在线 DDL&quot;概念——schema 演进就是同一进程内对本地 catalog/文件执行的事务性 DDL，没有并发 DDL 阻塞或在线迁移窗口问题）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只改定义不碰数据：ADD/DROP/RENAME COLUMN、改列 COMMENT/DEFAULT 都是 catalog 层变更；官方文档未明确说明物理重写代价（未找到证据）。</li>\n<li>重写数据但位置不变：ALTER ... TYPE 按表达式转换存量数据（USING 子句或默认 cast），转换失败整个语句报错回滚 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；列上有索引或 CHECK 约束依赖时先报依赖错误，需先删再建 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>搬数据：无分区键/排序键概念；大结构调整（换列顺序等）走 CREATE OR REPLACE TABLE AS 重建 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>验证约束：PRIMARY KEY/UNIQUE/NOT NULL/CHECK 支持（ADD PRIMARY KEY 自 v1.2，多列自 v1.5）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；ADD/DROP CONSTRAINT 不支持 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；FOREIGN KEY 语法存在但默认不强制 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。<ul>\n<li><strong>规模</strong>：代价取决于单机文件/数据量；改类型需转换全列数据，官方文档未给出代价模型（未找到证据）。</li>\n<li><strong>语义</strong>：ALTER 完全遵守事务语义——未提交对其他事务不可见、可回滚 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；单写者模型，无并发 DDL 概念 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Embedded single-process — no &quot;online DDL&quot; concept: schema evolution is just transactional DDL executed in-process against the local catalog/file, with no concurrent-…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Embedded single-process — no &quot;online DDL&quot; concept: schema evolution is just transactional DDL executed in-process against the local catalog/file, with no concurrent-DDL blocking or online-migration-window concern).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Definition-only, data untouched: ADD/DROP/RENAME COLUMN and COMMENT/DEFAULT changes are catalog-level operations; the official docs do not state their physical rewrite cost (no evidence found).</li>\n<li>Rewrite data in place: ALTER ... TYPE converts existing data per expression (USING clause or default cast); a failed conversion aborts the whole statement with rollback <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; columns with index or CHECK-constraint dependencies raise a dependency error first — drop and recreate <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Move data: no partition-key or sort-key concept; major restructures (e.g., column reordering) go through CREATE OR REPLACE TABLE AS rebuild <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Validate constraints: PRIMARY KEY/UNIQUE/NOT NULL/CHECK are supported (ADD PRIMARY KEY since v1.2, multi-column since v1.5) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; ADD/DROP CONSTRAINT is not supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; FOREIGN KEY syntax exists but is not enforced by default <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（嵌入式单进程，无多租户场景）。 嵌入式单进程，资源隔离无意义 官方文档。 单库单用户是典型用法，多租户请用服务端数据库 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（嵌入式单进程，无多租户场景）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>嵌入式单进程，资源隔离无意义 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>单库单用户是典型用法，多租户请用服务端数据库 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Embedded single-process; no multi-tenancy scenario). Embedded single process; resource isolation is meaningless <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Single-database single-user is the t…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Embedded single-process; no multi-tenancy scenario).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Embedded single process; resource isolation is meaningless <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Single-database single-user is the typical use; use a server database for multi-tenancy <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（嵌入式单机，无地域概念）。 单进程嵌入式，多活无意义 官方文档。 文件级复制可做异地备份，但不是多活语义 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（嵌入式单机，无地域概念）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单进程嵌入式，多活无意义 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>文件级复制可做异地备份，但不是多活语义 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Embedded single-node; no region concept). Single-process embedded; active-active is meaningless <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. File-level copies work for offsite backup, not activ…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Embedded single-node; no region concept).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Single-process embedded; active-active is meaningless <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>File-level copies work for offsite backup, not active-active semantics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（嵌入式单机，无 HA 语义）。 单进程嵌入式，HA 靠宿主应用/文件备份 官方文档。 进程崩溃靠宿主重启，单文件数据易备份 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（嵌入式单机，无 HA 语义）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单进程嵌入式，HA 靠宿主应用/文件备份 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>进程崩溃靠宿主重启，单文件数据易备份 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Embedded single-node; no HA semantics). Single-process embedded; HA is the host app&#x27;s / file backups&#x27; job <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Process crashes are the host&#x27;s restart con…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Embedded single-node; no HA semantics).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Single-process embedded; HA is the host app&#x27;s / file backups&#x27; job <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Process crashes are the host&#x27;s restart concern; the single-file data is easy to back up <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（嵌入式分析库，无访问控制）。 DuckDB 是嵌入式 OLAP 库，无用户 / 权限体系，原生无 RLS、列级权限与脱敏 官方文档 安全完全依赖宿主应用：文件权限、应用层过滤 社区共识 脱敏靠 SQL 视图或查询改写 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（嵌入式分析库，无访问控制）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DuckDB 是嵌入式 OLAP 库，无用户 / 权限体系，原生无 RLS、列级权限与脱敏 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>安全完全依赖宿主应用：文件权限、应用层过滤 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>脱敏靠 SQL 视图或查询改写 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Embedded analytics; no access control). DuckDB is an embedded OLAP library with no user / privilege system; natively no RLS, column privileges, or masking …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Embedded analytics; no access control).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DuckDB is an embedded OLAP library with no user / privilege system; natively no RLS, column privileges, or masking <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Security depends entirely on the host app: file permissions and app-layer filtering <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Masking via SQL views or query rewriting <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（JSON 扩展，自动推断）。 JSON 扩展，JSON 类型，-&gt;&gt; 提取，自动 schema 推断 官方文档。 嵌入式分析定位，超大半结构化文件注意内存 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（JSON 扩展，自动推断）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON 扩展，JSON 类型，-&gt;&gt; 提取，自动 schema 推断 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>嵌入式分析定位，超大半结构化文件注意内存 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (JSON extension, auto inference). JSON extension with JSON type, -&gt;&gt; extraction, auto schema inference <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Embedded analytics; watch memory on huge…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (JSON extension, auto inference).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON extension with JSON type, -&gt;&gt; extraction, auto schema inference <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Embedded analytics; watch memory on huge semi-structured files <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（FTS 扩展尚实验性）。 官方 FTS 扩展提供全文检索，尚实验性 官方文档。 生产关键词检索多靠 LIKE/正则或前置处理 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（FTS 扩展尚实验性）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>官方 FTS 扩展提供全文检索，尚实验性 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>生产关键词检索多靠 LIKE/正则或前置处理 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Experimental FTS extension). Official FTS extension offers full-text, still experimental <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Production keyword search often LIKE/regex or preproces…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Experimental FTS extension).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Official FTS extension offers full-text, still experimental <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Production keyword search often LIKE/regex or preprocessing <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用——进程内嵌入式，无服务端/用户体系、无 GRANT 模型；文件系统权限即权限边界。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（架构）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>——进程内嵌入式，无服务端/用户体系、无 GRANT 模型；文件系统权限即权限边界。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（架构）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A — in-process e</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A — in-process embedded, no server/user system, no GRANT model; filesystem permissions are the permission boundary. Evidence: official docs (architecture).</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> — in-process embedded, no server/user system, no GRANT model; filesystem permissions are the permission boundary. Evidence: official docs (architecture).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（列存+轻量编码自动压缩）。 列式存储格式，对每列自动选择轻量压缩编码（RLE、字典、位-packed、FSST 等）。官方文档 压缩为默认自动行为，无需配置，Parquet 读写同样高效。官方文档 嵌入式场景下压缩比表现优秀，是其单文件分析的核心优势之一。社区实测</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（列存+轻量编码自动压缩）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>列式存储格式，对每列自动选择轻量压缩编码（RLE、字典、位-packed、FSST 等）。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>压缩为默认自动行为，无需配置，Parquet 读写同样高效。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>嵌入式场景下压缩比表现优秀，是其单文件分析的核心优势之一。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Columnar with lightweight encoding compression). Columnar storage format with automatic per-column lightweight encodings (RLE, dictionary, bit-packed, FSST, et…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Columnar with lightweight encoding compression).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Columnar storage format with automatic per-column lightweight encodings (RLE, dictionary, bit-packed, FSST, etc.). <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Compression is default automatic behavior requiring no configuration; Parquet I/O is equally efficient. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Excellent ratios in embedded scenarios — a core advantage of its single-file analytics story. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（MIT 开源；嵌入式无锁定）。 DuckDB 采用 MIT 协议开源，是最宽松的主流开源协议之一。官方文档 嵌入式进程内数据库，无服务端、无云绑定，从设计上不存在厂商锁定。社区共识 无协议变更黑历史，基金会治理模式清晰。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（MIT 开源；嵌入式无锁定）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DuckDB 采用 MIT 协议开源，是最宽松的主流开源协议之一。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>嵌入式进程内数据库，无服务端、无云绑定，从设计上不存在厂商锁定。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>无协议变更黑历史，基金会治理模式清晰。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (MIT open source; embedded, no lock-in). DuckDB is open source under the MIT license, one of the most permissive mainstream licenses. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> An emb…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (MIT open source; embedded, no lock-in).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DuckDB is open source under the MIT license, one of the most permissive mainstream licenses. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>An embedded in-process database with no server and no cloud binding — vendor lock-in is impossible by design. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>No license-change history; foundation governance is clear. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（向量化 CBO；自动优化好，无 hint）。 向量化执行 + CBO，EXPLAIN 完备，小查询优化出色 官方文档。 无 hint 机制，计划干预手段少 官方文档。 嵌入式场景计划翻转风险低 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（向量化 CBO；自动优化好，无 hint）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>向量化执行 + CBO，EXPLAIN 完备，小查询优化出色 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无 hint 机制，计划干预手段少 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>嵌入式场景计划翻转风险低 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Vectorized CBO; great auto-optimization, no hints). Vectorized execution + CBO, full EXPLAIN, excellent small-query optimization <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No hint mecha…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Vectorized CBO; great auto-optimization, no hints).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vectorized execution + CBO, full EXPLAIN, excellent small-query optimization <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No hint mechanism; few plan-steering levers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Low plan-flip risk in embedded scenarios <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（零配置自治：PRAGMA 少量参数）。 开箱即用，PRAGMA 参数少且有合理默认 官方文档。 内存/线程自动感知，自治程度在嵌入式库中突出 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（零配置自治：PRAGMA 少量参数）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开箱即用，PRAGMA 参数少且有合理默认 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>内存/线程自动感知，自治程度在嵌入式库中突出 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Zero-config autonomy; few PRAGMAs). Works out of the box; few PRAGMAs with sane defaults <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Auto-detects memory/threads; notably autonomous among…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Zero-config autonomy; few PRAGMAs).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Works out of the box; few PRAGMAs with sane defaults <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Auto-detects memory/threads; notably autonomous among embedded DBs <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-tbd\">未找到证据</span><p class=\"snippet\">未找到证据（未见公开的页校验或损坏自愈机制）。 未找到官方文档描述页 checksum、损坏检测或自愈流程。待验证 作为嵌入式 OLAP 引擎，文件损坏多靠上层应用或备份策略兜底。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>未找到证据</strong>（未见公开的页校验或损坏自愈机制）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>未找到官方文档描述页 checksum、损坏检测或自愈流程。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n<li>作为嵌入式 OLAP 引擎，文件损坏多靠上层应用或备份策略兜底。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No evidence found</span><p class=\"snippet\">No evidence found (No public check/self-heal mechanism). No official documentation found describing page checksums, corruption detection, or self-healing. (to be verified…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>No evidence found</strong> (No public check/self-heal mechanism).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No official documentation found describing page checksums, corruption detection, or self-healing. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n<li>As an embedded OLAP engine, file corruption is mostly left to the host application or backup strategy. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无存储过程/触发器）。 无存储过程、触发器（查证为无）官方文档。 逻辑在宿主语言（Python/R）中 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无存储过程/触发器）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无存储过程、触发器（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>逻辑在宿主语言（Python/R）中 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified: no procedures/triggers). No stored procedures or triggers (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Logic in host language (Python/R) (community consens…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified: no procedures/triggers).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No stored procedures or triggers (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Logic in host language (Python/R) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（单机主键/外键/CHECK 完整）。 主键、外键、CHECK、唯一约束完整（单机）官方文档。 分析场景常关闭约束以提速，约束主要起语义作用 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（单机主键/外键/CHECK 完整）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>主键、外键、CHECK、唯一约束完整（单机）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>分析场景常关闭约束以提速，约束主要起语义作用 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Full single-node constraints). Full PK, FK, CHECK, unique constraints (single-node) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Often disabled for speed in analytics; mainly semantic (co…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Full single-node constraints).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Full PK, FK, CHECK, unique constraints (single-node) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Often disabled for speed in analytics; mainly semantic <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（分析 SQL 强项，窗口完备）。 窗口函数、CTE、PIVOT 等分析 SQL 为强项 官方文档。 单机内存/磁盘上限是天花板 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（分析 SQL 强项，窗口完备）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>窗口函数、CTE、PIVOT 等分析 SQL 为强项 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>单机内存/磁盘上限是天花板 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Analytical SQL is its strength). Window functions, CTEs, PIVOT — analytical SQL is its strength <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Single-node memory/disk is the ceiling (commun…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Analytical SQL is its strength).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Window functions, CTEs, PIVOT — analytical SQL is its strength <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Single-node memory/disk is the ceiling <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（DELETE即删；文件残留靠VACUUM）。 DELETE 删除行，但数据库文件历史页可能残留，需 VACUUM / 重写文件 社区共识 嵌入式场景下“擦除”等价于文件级管控：删文件最彻底 社区实测 无擦除证明 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（DELETE即删；文件残留靠VACUUM）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DELETE 删除行，但数据库文件历史页可能残留，需 VACUUM / 重写文件 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>嵌入式场景下“擦除”等价于文件级管控：删文件最彻底 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>无擦除证明 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (DELETE removes rows; file residue needs VACUUM). DELETE removes rows, but database file history pages may retain data; VACUUM / file rewrite is needed (community…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (DELETE removes rows; file residue needs VACUUM).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DELETE removes rows, but database file history pages may retain data; VACUUM / file rewrite is needed <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>In embedded scenarios erasure equals file-level control: deleting the file is the most thorough option <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>No erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（嵌入式场景无血缘，查证为无）。 无原生血缘；嵌入式定位通常不需要 官方文档。 可通过上层工具链补齐 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（嵌入式场景无血缘，查证为无）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生血缘；嵌入式定位通常不需要 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>可通过上层工具链补齐 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified none; embedded scope needs none). No native lineage; embedded positioning rarely needs it <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Upper toolchains can fill the gap (comm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified none; embedded scope needs none).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native lineage; embedded positioning rarely needs it <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Upper toolchains can fill the gap <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——无在线备份工具、无 WAL 归档、无 PITR。可用方式：EXPORT DATABASE &#x27;dir&#x27; (FORMAT PARQUET)（MVCC 一致快照，可在线，是社区推荐默认方式）、COPY FROM DATABASE 跨库拷贝、进程关闭后直接拷贝 .duckdb 文件；打开状态下直接 cp 文件可能损坏<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。恢复…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——无在线备份工具、无 WAL 归档、无 PITR。可用方式：<code>EXPORT DATABASE &#x27;dir&#x27; (FORMAT PARQUET)</code>（MVCC 一致快照，可在线，是社区推荐默认方式）、<code>COPY FROM DATABASE</code> 跨库拷贝、进程关闭后直接拷贝 <code>.duckdb</code> 文件；<strong>打开状态下直接 cp 文件可能损坏</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。恢复 = <code>IMPORT DATABASE</code> 或文件替换。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — no online backup tool, no WAL archiving, no PITR. Available: EXPORT DATABASE &#x27;dir&#x27; (FORMAT PARQUET) (MVCC-consistent snapshot, online, the community…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — no online backup tool, no WAL archiving, no PITR. Available: <code>EXPORT DATABASE &#x27;dir&#x27; (FORMAT PARQUET)</code> (MVCC-consistent snapshot, online, the community-recommended default), <code>COPY FROM DATABASE</code> for cross-database copies, copying the <code>.duckdb</code> file after the process closes; <strong>copying the file while the database is open can corrupt it</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Restore = <code>IMPORT DATABASE</code> or file replacement. Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存算一体：进程内嵌入式）。 进程内嵌入式，存储即本地文件，存算一体 官方文档。 无网络开销，但无法独立扩展计算/存储 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存算一体：进程内嵌入式）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>进程内嵌入式，存储即本地文件，存算一体 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无网络开销，但无法独立扩展计算/存储 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Coupled: in-process embedded). In-process embedded; storage is local files; coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No network overhead, but compute/storage can&#x27;t scale indep…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Coupled: in-process embedded).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In-process embedded; storage is local files; coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No network overhead, but compute/storage can&#x27;t scale independently <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（关系+JSON+FTS/VSS 扩展）。 JSON 类型，FTS（全文）、VSS（向量）为官方扩展 官方文档。 无图引擎 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（关系+JSON+FTS/VSS 扩展）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON 类型，FTS（全文）、VSS（向量）为官方扩展 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无图引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Relational + JSON + FTS/VSS extensions). JSON type; FTS (full-text) and VSS (vector) as official extensions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No graph engine (community consensus…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Relational + JSON + FTS/VSS extensions).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON type; FTS (full-text) and VSS (vector) as official extensions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No graph engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（嵌入式无计费，成本并入宿主应用）。 嵌入式进程内运行，无独立计费概念，成本并入宿主应用的硬件与人力。社区共识 母公司 MotherDuck 的云托管版另有按量计费。厂商口径</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（嵌入式无计费，成本并入宿主应用）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>嵌入式进程内运行，无独立计费概念，成本并入宿主应用的硬件与人力。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>母公司 MotherDuck 的云托管版另有按量计费。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No metering; cost folds into host). Runs embedded in-process with no independent metering; cost folds into the host application&#x27;s hardware and labor. (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No metering; cost folds into host).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Runs embedded in-process with no independent metering; cost folds into the host application&#x27;s hardware and labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>MotherDuck&#x27;s hosted cloud edition has separate usage-based billing. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（嵌入式驱动全：Python/R/JDBC/ODBC）。 Python/R/Node/Java/JDBC/ODBC 官方驱动完备 官方文档。 零依赖安装是开发体验优势 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（嵌入式驱动全：Python/R/JDBC/ODBC）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Python/R/Node/Java/JDBC/ODBC 官方驱动完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>零依赖安装是开发体验优势 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Full embedded drivers: Python/R/JDBC/ODBC). Complete official Python/R/Node/Java/JDBC/ODBC drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Zero-dependency install is a DX win (commun…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Full embedded drivers: Python/R/JDBC/ODBC).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete official Python/R/Node/Java/JDBC/ODBC drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Zero-dependency install is a DX win <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无；CTAS 模拟）。 无物化视图（查证为无）官方文档。 用 CREATE TABLE AS + 定时重建模拟 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无；CTAS 模拟）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无物化视图（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>用 CREATE TABLE AS + 定时重建模拟 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified absent; CTAS instead). No materialized views (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Simulate with CREATE TABLE AS + scheduled rebuilds (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified absent; CTAS instead).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No materialized views (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Simulate with CREATE TABLE AS + scheduled rebuilds <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（嵌入式，无云绑定）。 嵌入式库，跑在哪里由宿主决定，无云厂商绑定 官方文档。 跨云概念不适用，文件拷到哪里算哪里 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（嵌入式，无云绑定）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>嵌入式库，跑在哪里由宿主决定，无云厂商绑定 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云概念不适用，文件拷到哪里算哪里 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Embedded; no cloud binding). Embedded library; the host decides where it runs — no cloud binding <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cross-cloud is N/A; the file runs wherever you copy…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Embedded; no cloud binding).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Embedded library; the host decides where it runs — no cloud binding <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-cloud is N/A; the file runs wherever you copy it <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（乐观并发冲突即回滚，应用负责重试）。 并发原语为进程内乐观并发（MVCC+undo buffer），无行锁；纯 append 永不冲突，但两个线程同时更新同一行会触发写冲突检测 官方文档。 冲突时后来者直接 abort，抛 TransactionException（&quot;Conflict on update!&quot;），内核与驱动都不重试…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（乐观并发冲突即回滚，应用负责重试）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并发原语为进程内乐观并发（MVCC+undo buffer），无行锁；纯 append 永不冲突，但两个线程同时更新同一行会触发写冲突检测 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>冲突时后来者直接 abort，抛 TransactionException（&quot;Conflict on update!&quot;），内核与驱动都不重试，应用必须捕获后整体重执事务，重试逻辑全在应用层 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n<li>热点打到同一行上意味着持续 abort：并发度越高失败率越高，TPS 在重试风暴下崩塌；单文件单写进程是硬瓶颈，第二个进程的写连接会被文件锁直接挡住 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>未找到官方命名或文档化的热点行机制的证据；列存引擎下高频点更新本身即反模式 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>推荐模式是单写者队列或微批 append-only 建模（append 永不冲突），代价是放弃并发写入并引入队列串行化延迟与运维复杂度 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (optimistic concurrency aborts on conflict; the app must retry). The concurrency primitive is in-process optimistic concurrency (MVCC + undo buffers) …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (optimistic concurrency aborts on conflict; the app must retry).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The concurrency primitive is in-process optimistic concurrency (MVCC + undo buffers) with no row locks; pure appends never conflict, but two threads updating the same row trigger write-conflict detection <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>On conflict the loser aborts immediately with a TransactionException (&quot;Conflict on update!&quot;); neither the kernel nor the driver retries — the application must catch it and re-execute the whole transaction, so all retry logic lives in the app (community tested).</li>\n<li>A hotspot on one row means repeated aborts: the higher the concurrency, the higher the failure rate, and TPS collapses under the retry storm; one writer process per file is a hard bottleneck, and a second process&#x27;s write connection is blocked by the file lock outright <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>There is no officially named or documented hotspot-row mechanism found; frequent point updates are themselves an anti-pattern on a columnar engine (to be verified).</li>\n<li>The recommended pattern is a single-writer queue or micro-batch append-only modeling (appends never conflict), at the cost of giving up concurrent writes and adding queue serialization latency and operational complexity <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});